@startuml "Gestion des commandes - Organisateur"

title Consultation des commandes d'un événement

actor "Organisateur" as Organizer
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "Event Service" as EventSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Gestion des commandes ==
Organizer -> Frontend: Voir commandes événement
Frontend -> API: GET /api/events/{eventId}/orders
API -> Auth: Vérifier propriété événement
Auth --> API: access granted

API -> EventSvc: getEventOrders(eventId)
EventSvc -> DB: SELECT orders WITH tickets, users WHERE eventId=?
DB --> EventSvc: orders list
EventSvc --> API: orders data
API --> Frontend: orders list
Frontend --> Organizer: Liste des commandes

@enduml